   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rich and Poor(RAPP) - Media consultant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to put Equality for Growth on the public agenda in Kenya. With a more equal Kenya where economic growth benefits poor people and regions more than rich people and regions. In the project document we do state a few examples of the extreme inequalities in Kenya which goes along with our country hyponthesis and Strategy for Kenya analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
